4.  POWER -- sigma(Q) anchored on the REAL catalogue, not on an assumed error
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  sigma(median vtilde) per bin is measured from the data's own vtilde scatter: 1.253 sigma/sqrt(N) for a
